  <!-- EN: An assault rifle that fires long steel darts instead of bullets. Its darts keep their line and speed underwater, where ordinary guns lose three quarters of their range, but out of the water it reaches noticeably less far than a regular assault rifle. -->
  <DepthRim_Gun_UnderwaterRifle.description>發射細長鋼鏢而非子彈的突擊步槍。鋼鏢在水中能保持彈道與速度；一般槍械在水裡會損失四分之三的射程，這把不會。但離開水面後，它的射程明顯比一般突擊步槍短。</DepthRim_Gun_UnderwaterRifle.description>
